                                "text": "1983, S. M. Al-Sabah, Development Planning in an Oil Economy and the Role of the Woman: The Case of Kuwait, London : Eastlords Pub.\nThere is no question that the mail survey is \"the most practical method for obtaining reasonably compatible data across a large geographic base, a large heterogenic group, and also a large sample size\"."
